Apple today <a href="https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2026/05/wackadoo-join-bluey-for-the-ultimate-playdate-on-apple-arcade-starting-may-21/">announced</a> that characters from the hit animated kids show Bluey are coming to five Apple Arcade games starting Thursday, May 21, as part of a limited-time crossover event. The games that will be receiving Bluey updates include <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/crossy-road-castle/id1489275350">Crossy Road Castle</a>, <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/stitch/id1581052096">stitch.</a>, <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/puffies/id1659992476">puffies.</a>, <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/suika-game/id6741622025">Suika Game+</a>, and <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/disney-coloring-world/id1644114544">Disney Coloring World+</a>. <br/>
<br/>
